    "text": "12 hours ago Rockdale County Restaurant Report Card – 06/02/2026 The Gwinnett, Newton & Rockdale County Health Departments conducted food service inspections in Rockdale County on 06/02/2026. The following 3 establishments were inspected.\n🔴 Grade U (Failing) = below 70 | 🟠 Grade C = 70–79 | 🟡 Grade B = 80–89 | 🟢 Grade A = 90–100\n🟡 Grade B (80–89) — 1 location\nBojangles - Conyers — 🟡 83 (Grade B)• Inspected: 06-02-2026 • 1970 GA-138 Conyers GA 30013\n🟢 Grade A (90–100) — 2 locations\nKnights Restaurant & Lounge — 🟢 97 (Grade A)• Inspected: 06-02-2026 • 1135 Sigman Rd Suite A Conyers GA 30012YD Restaurant Inc dba Kozi Sushi & Ramen — 🟢 98 (Grade A)• Inspected: 06-02-2026 • 425 Sigman Rd NW Ste 101 Conyers GA 30012\nSource: Gwinnett, Newton & Rockdale County Health Departments. Data reflects food service inspections conducted on 06/02/2026.",
